  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the air fryer to 200°C.",
    "Toss the diced potatoes with salted butter, paprika, thyme, pepper, and a pinch of salt.",
    "Spread the potatoes in a single layer in the air fryer basket.",
    "Cook for 10 minutes, shaking the basket halfway through.",
    "Add the diced onion and cook for an additional 6 minutes.",
    "Stir in minced garlic and cook 2 more minutes until fragrant.",
    "Transfer the hash to a bowl and sprinkle with fresh parsley.",
    "Serve hot with a side of low‑fat yogurt or a splash of lemon juice if desired."
